      "value": "@{6015a8dedd548068697b6112|full_name} Thank you, but none of these actually solve the problem. I am aware of all of these things.\n\nIf I do any of these, it interrupts my normal notifications. I just want to be able to opt-out of 5-15+ notifications in a single night from a community without having to mute all of their notifications.",
