  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2024-02-05T18:14:28.597Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "It would be great if users could select \"notification channels\" to subscribe to for a group.\n\nOften, group owners will spam updates every 30-60 minutes if they are running some sort of complex event or DJ event. It gets tiring to see, or annoying in-game with the pings.\n\nBeing able to have different channels would solve this problem. They could create \"Main\" and \"Granular\" notification channel, and the user can subscribe to them as they wish. Similar to using roles or channels in Discord.",
